Package: python3-slab-cortex-m
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-yaml
Description: Rehost ARM Cortex-M firmware with Python peripheral control
 SLAB is a QEMU-based platform for ARM Cortex-M firmware rehosting.
 All MMIO accesses are forwarded to Python peripheral models via TCP
 or shared memory, enabling firmware testing without hardware.
